line, or down (`false`).\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID for individual component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_capacity_mw\":{\"description\":\"Maximum total capacity across all eligible resources. Units: MW.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MW\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"target_year\":{\"description\":\"Year in which this requirement is applied.\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"name\",\"id\",\"available\"],\"title\":\"MaximumCapacityRequirements\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"MinMax\":{\"description\":\"A pair of values bounding a quantity from below (`min`) and from above (`max`).\",\"properties\":{\"max\":{\"title\":\"Max\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"min\":{\"title\":\"Min\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"MinMax\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"MinimumCapacityRequirements\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"Policy requirement that the total capacity of all eligible technologies in the target year be greater than or equal to the specified minimum in MW.\",\"properties\":{\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the component is connected and online (`true`) or disconnected, offline, or down (`false`).\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID for individual component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"min_capacity_mw\":{\"description\":\"Minimum total capacity across all eligible resources. Units: MW.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MW\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"target_year\":{\"description\":\"Year in which this requirement is applied.\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"name\",\"id\",\"available\"],\"title\":\"MinimumCapacityRequirements\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"NodalACTransportTechnology\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"Nodal representation of candidate AC transmission lines between two regions. Alongside capacity limits an